{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","text":"RecordStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","text":"Consent","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","text":"Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { Date.now })","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event is kept.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}]}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}],"name":"now"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a stage reading "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"type":"text","text":", a record is written once its category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the recovered records from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything tracked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given "},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again."}]}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Initializer","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV5store7consent9enrichers8samplers12samplingSeed3nowACx_AA7ConsentVSgSayAA8EnricherVGSayAA7SamplerVGs6UInt64V20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctc11Persistence11RecordStoreRzlufc","symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":")","kind":"t